   766	   (0.5)--(0.6) all need `mu-1 >= 1`.
   767	2. *The `2mu` per component is an input, not an output.*  In the producer it
   768	   comes from `sum_j e_j f_j = mu` for `Ubar -> Y` multiplied by "the
   769	   rank-two local factor of `pi`" -- i.e. it presupposes that the generic
