+## 6. Assembly of (M'), defect form, and weighted budget
+
+**(M') — CONFIRMED.**  Under H2, Lemma 3.3 gives
+
+`chi_c(F^{-1}(D))=a chi_c(D_0)+sum_p a_p`.
